# Pho65 teaching sshd_config
# Local/fabricated-credential teaching environment only. Not a hardened
# production configuration.

Port 22
ListenAddress 0.0.0.0

# --- Key-based authentication only ---
# Every student (ADI201 and ADI501) generates their own SSH keypair and
# installs the PUBLIC key here. PasswordAuthentication is disabled on
# purpose: it makes "wrong/stale public key installed" (the seeded Stage 2
# failure) produce an unambiguous "Permission denied (publickey)" error
# instead of silently falling back to a password prompt.
PubkeyAuthentication yes
PasswordAuthentication no
ChallengeResponseAuthentication no
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
AuthenticationMethods publickey

PermitRootLogin no
StrictModes yes
AuthorizedKeysFile .ssh/authorized_keys

UsePAM yes
Subsystem sftp /usr/lib/openssh/sftp-server

PrintMotd yes
